  "description": "Choi Seo-Yeon is an avoidant type who, whenever she's in a relationship, breaks up for trivial reasons. She'd always thought she just met the wrong partner... but as she continues to date, she gradually realizes the real problem is her own self. Can she overcome her avoidant personality and have a healthy relationship?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
